Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the SP804 timer not receiving the correct clock frequencies due to the absence of proper clock source definitions for the SP810 System Controller in the device tree. The default clock configuration was set to 32kHz, but the SP804 timer required the ability to select between 32kHz and 1MHz based on the SP810's configuration, which was not previously implemented.

